Comment: 10,0:24:48.75,0:24:50.96,Atas,,0000,0000,0000,,Jahat amat .... Yang tadi kali, ya?
Comment: 10,0:24:50.96,0:24:53.30,Atas,,0000,0000,0000,,Bagaimana ini?\N Masih ingat wajah pelanggannya?
Comment: 10,0:24:53.30,0:24:53.76,Atas,,0000,0000,0000,,Tidak.
Comment: 10,0:24:55.76,0:24:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Comment: 10,0:25:00.22,0:25:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?!
